{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"571","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Campus"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Oscolcovo city has a campus consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" student dormitories, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" universities and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" military offices. Initially, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th dormitory belongs to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th university and is assigned to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th military office."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Life goes on and the campus is continuously going through some changes. The changes can be of four types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" University "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":" merges with university "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bj"},{"kind":"text","text":". After that all the dormitories that belonged to university "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bj"},{"kind":"text","text":" are assigned to to university "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":", and university "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bj"},{"kind":"text","text":" disappears. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Military office "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cj"},{"kind":"text","text":" merges with military office "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"dj"},{"kind":"text","text":". After that all the dormitories that were assigned to military office "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"dj"},{"kind":"text","text":", are assigned to military office "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cj"},{"kind":"text","text":", and military office "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"dj"},{"kind":"text","text":" disappears. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Students of university "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xj"},{"kind":"text","text":" move in dormitories. Lets "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"kxj"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the number of dormitories that belong to this university at the time when the students move in. Then the number of students in each dormitory of university "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xj"},{"kind":"text","text":" increases by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"kxj"},{"kind":"text","text":" (note that the more dormitories belong to the university, the more students move in each dormitory of the university). "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Military office number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yj"},{"kind":"text","text":" conducts raids on all the dormitories assigned to it and takes all students from there. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thus, at each moment of time each dormitory is assigned to exactly one university and one military office. Initially, all the dormitory are empty."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to process the changes that take place in the campus and answer the queries, how many people currently live in dormitory "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"qj"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n, m ≤ 5·105)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of dormitories and the number of queries, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the queries, each of them is given in one of the following formats: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"U"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bj"},{"kind":"text","text":"» — merging universities; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"M"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cj"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"dj"},{"kind":"text","text":"» — merging military offices; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xj"},{"kind":"text","text":"» — students of university "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xj"},{"kind":"text","text":" moving in the dormitories; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yj"},{"kind":"text","text":"» — a raid in military office "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yj"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Q"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"qj"},{"kind":"text","text":"» — a query asking the number of people in dormitory "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"qj"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" All the numbers in the queries are positive integers and do not exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". It is guaranteed that at the moment of the query the universities and military offices, that are present in the query, exist."}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line print the answer to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th query asking the number of people in the dormitory."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 7\nA 1\nQ 1\nU 1 2\nA 1\nZ 1\nQ 1\nQ 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n0\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 12\nU 1 2\nM 4 5\nA 1\nQ 1\nA 3\nA 4\nQ 3\nQ 4\nZ 4\nQ 4\nA 5\nQ 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n1\n1\n0\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider the first sample test: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In the first query university 1 owns only dormitory 1, so after the query dormitory 1 will have 1 student. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" After the third query university 1 owns dormitories 1 and 2. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The fourth query increases by 2 the number of students living in dormitories 1 and 2 that belong to university number 1. After that 3 students live in the first dormitory and 2 students live in the second dormitory. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" At the fifth query the number of students living in dormitory 1, assigned to the military office 1, becomes zero. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"571D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/571/problem/D"}